Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Oh, whoa ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.93,0:00:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Won't you come see about me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I'll be alone,\Ndancing, you know it, baby ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Tell me your troubles\Nand doubts ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Giving me everything\Ninside and out ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ and love's strange\Nso real in the dark ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Think of the tender things\Nthat we were working on ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Slow change\Nmay pull us apart ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When the light gets\Ninto your heart, baby ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't you forget about me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't, don't, don't, don't ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't you forget about me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you stand above me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Look my way,\Nbut never love me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Rain keeps falling,\Nrain keeps falling ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:02:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Down, down, down ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Brian: Saturday,\NMarch 24th, 1984.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shermer High School,\NShermer, Illinois 60062.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dear Mr. Vernon,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We accept the fact that we had\Nto sacrifice a whole Saturday{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in detention for whatever\Nit was we did wrong.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What we did was wrong,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}but we think you're crazy\Nto make us write an essay{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}telling you\Nwho we think we are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do you care?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see us\Nas you want to see us{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in the simplest terms,\Nin the most{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}convenient definitions.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see us as a brain,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}an athlete,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}a basket case,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}princess,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and a criminal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Correct?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the way\Nwe saw each other{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}at 7:00 this morning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We were brainwashed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't believe\Nyou can't get me out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so absurd I have\Nto be here on a Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like\NI'm a defective or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, ditching class\Nto go shopping
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't make you a defective.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is this the first time\Nor the last time we do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, get in there and use\Nthe time to your advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom, we're not supposed\Nto study.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to sit there\Nand do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, mister, you figure out\Na way to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, I screwed around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys screw around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,except you got caught, sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, mom already reamed me,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want to miss a match?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to blow your ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, no school is going\Nto give a scholarship
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to a discipline case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,(snickers)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, well, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to congratulate you\Nfor being on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's detention, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I belong in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- It is now 7:06.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have exactly\N8 hours and 54 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to think about\Nwhy you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ponder the error of your ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,(spits)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And you may not talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not move\Nfrom these seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,will not sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, people,\Nwe're going to try something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,a little different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going to write an essay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,of no less than 1,000 words
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:06:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,describing to me\Nwho you think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is this a test?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- And when I say essay,\NI mean essay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not mean a single word\Nrepeated 1,000 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear, Mr. Bender?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good, maybe you'll learn\Na little something
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll even decide whether\Nor not you care to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, you know, I can answer\Nthat right now, sir, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,that'd be no.\NNo for me because--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sit down, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- My office\Nis right across that hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Any monkey business\Nis ill advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Barry Manilow know\Nthat you raid his wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give you the answer\Nto that question, Mr. Bender,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,next Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with the bull,\Nyoung man, you'll get the horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- That man is a brownie hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,(biting nails)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep eating your hand,\Nyou're not going
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,to be hungry for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.23,0:08:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen you before, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who do I think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a walrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the shits, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(chuckles)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,(crumples paper)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(humming)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't believe this is\Nreally happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do\Nif we have to take a piss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please.\N- If you got to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you got to go.\N(unzips pants)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, you're not urinating\Nin here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't talk, don't talk.\NIt makes it crawl back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- You whip it out\Nand you're dead
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,before the first drop\Nhits the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty sexy\Nwhen you get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, homeboy, why don't you\Ngo close that door,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll get\Nthe prom queen impregnated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy: Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- If I lose my temper\Nyou're totaled, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Totally?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why don't you just shut up?\NNobody here is interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Butt face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, hey, sport-o,\Nwhat'd you do to get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget to wash your jock?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, fellas, I think\Nwe should just write our papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look, just because you live\Nin here doesn't give you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the right to be a pain\Nin the ass, so knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.51,0:11:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's a free country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's just doing it\Nto get a rise out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.02,0:11:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't ignore me\Nif you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you guys, like,\Nboyfriend, girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Steady dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.45,0:11:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, sport-o,\Nlevel with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you slip her\Nthe hot beef injection?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go to hell!\N- Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Spoiled little pricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you say\Nwe close that door?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have any kind of party\Nwith Vernon checking us out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,every few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know, the door's\Nsupposed to stay open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.03,0:12:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- So what?\N- So why don't you just shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.95,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's four other people\Nin here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- God, you can count.\NSee, I knew you had to be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,smart to be a wrestler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who the hell are you\Nto judge anybody anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy: You know, Bender,\Nyou don't even count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nif you disappear forever
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.87,0:12:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You may as well not even\Nexist at this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.09,0:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I'll just run right out\Nand join the wrestling team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the prep club, too,\Nstudent council.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, they wouldn't take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know why guys like you\Nknock everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, this should be stunning.\N- It's because you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, God, you richies\Nare so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why\NI'm not heavy in activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're a big coward.\N- I'm in the math club.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- See, you're afraid\Nthat they won't take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't belong so you\Njust have to dump all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, it wouldn't have\Nanything to do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,with you activities people\Nbeing assholes, now, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, you wouldn't know.\NYou don't even know any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I don't know any lepers,\Neither, but I'm not going
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to run out and join\None of their fucking clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's watch the mouth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm in the physics club, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me a second.\NWhat are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, what I'd said was\Nthat I'm in the math club,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the Latin club,\Nand the physics club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Physics club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherry, do you belong\Nto the physics club?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's an academic club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- So academic clubs\Naren't the same
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,as other kinds of clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, but to dorks like him\Nthey are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you guys do\Nin your club?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- In physics, well,\Nwe talk about physics,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,properties of physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:14:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- So it's sort of social,\Ndemented and sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but social, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, well, I guess you could\Nconsider it a social situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there are other children\Nin my club
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and at the end of the year\Nwe have, we have, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,a big a banquet at the Hilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- You load up, you party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.11,0:14:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, well, we get dressed up.\NI mean, but we don't get high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Only burners like you\Nget high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- And I didn't have any shoes,\Nso I had to borrow my dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It was kind of weird\Nbecause my mom doesn't like me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to wear other people's shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And my cousin Ken--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.29,0:14:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My cousin Kendall from Indiana,\Nhe got high once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And, you know,\Nhe started eating, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,really weird foods\Nand then he just felt like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,he didn't belong anywhere,\Nyou know, kind of, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, Twilight Zone,\Nkind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sounds like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look, you guys keep up\Nyour talking and Vernon's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,going to come right in here.\NI got a meet this Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to miss it\Non account of you boneheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, and wouldn't that\Nbe a bite, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, missing\Na whole wrestling meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, you wouldn't know\Nanything about it, faggot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You never competed\Nin your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I feel all empty inside\Nbecause of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have such a deep admiration\Nfor guys who roll around
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,on the floor with other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, you'd never miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.37,0:15:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, but I do.\N- Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want to be just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I figure all I need\Nis a lobotomy and some tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- You wear tights?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I don't wear tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wear the required uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tights.\N- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(scribbling)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- (snorts)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Brian: You know,\Nthere's not supposed to be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,any monkey business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Young man,\Nhave you finished your paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy: Come on, Bender,\Ndon't screw around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Drop dead, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- (shouting)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bender, that's\Nschool property there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's, you know,\Nit doesn't belong to us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's something\Nthat's not to be toyed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's very funny.\NCome on, fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.60,0:16:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Brian:\NYou should really fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Am I a genius?\N- No, you're an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a funny guy.\N- Fix the door, Bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everyone just shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I've been here before,\NI know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy: No, fix the door.\NGet up there and fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bender: Shut up!\NVernon: Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that door closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that door closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- How are we supposed to know?\NWe're not supposed to move,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're just sitting here\Nlike we're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who closed that door?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think a screw\Nfell out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- It just closed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(squeals)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.61,0:17:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- She doesn't talk, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me that screw.\N- I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want me\Nto yank you out of that seat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and shake it out of you?\N- I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Screws fall out all the time.\NThe world's an imperfect place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give it to me, Bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, sir, why would\Nanybody want to steal a screw?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Watch it, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- The door's way too heavy, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.69,0:17:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(muttering)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Andrew Clark.\N(snaps fingers)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.45,0:17:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up here.\NCome on, front and center.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:17:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.\N(snapping fingers)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.83,0:18:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, how come Andrew\Ngets to get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: That's right.\NBender: If he gets up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll all get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.42,0:18:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: Okay. Watch it.\NWatch the magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bender: It's out of my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very clever, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if there's a fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I think violating fire codes\Nand endangering the lives
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,of children would be unwise\Nat that this juncture
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.65,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,in your career, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right,\Nwhat are you doing with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.28,0:18:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this out of here,\Nfor God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, you know the school\Ncomes equipped with fire exists
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,at either end of the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Show Dick some respect.\N- Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. Get back in your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected a little more\Nfrom a varsity letterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.47,0:18:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not fooling anybody,\NBender.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The next screw that falls out\Nis going to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- (mutters) Eat my shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:18:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Eat my shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- You just bought yourself\Nanother Saturday, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I'm crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- You just bought one more\Nright there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I'm free\Nthe Saturday after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, I'm going\Nto have to check my calendar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good!\NBecause it's going to be filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You want another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Say the word.\NJust say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of going to prison\Nyou'll come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you through?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm doing society a favor.\N- So?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's another one right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you for the rest\Nof your natural born life
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't watch your step.\NYou want another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You got another one right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's another one, pal.\N- Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.77,0:19:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(mouthing word)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: You through?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not even close, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good, you got one more\Nright there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- You really think\NI give a shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You through?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- How many is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's seven including\Nwhen we first came in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:20:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and you asked Mr. Vernon here\Nwhether Barry Manilow
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,knew that he raided his closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now it's eight.\NYou stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, sir, it's seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut up, Pee Wee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine, Bender.\NFor two months I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.39,0:20:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- What can I say?\NI'm thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I'm sure that's exactly\Nwhat you want these people
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to believe.\NYou know something, Bender?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to spend\Na little more time trying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.69,0:20:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to do something with yourself\Nand a little less time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to impress people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be\Nright outside those doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.95,0:20:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time I have to come\Nin here I'm cracking skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(mouthing words)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.87,0:22:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.67,0:22:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has to go to the lavatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's real intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.81,0:23:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.77,0:23:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wrong\Nto destroy literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.11,0:23:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such fun to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mollay really pumps my nads.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Moliére.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- I love his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.18,0:23:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to do\Nwhen you're locked in a vacancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.60,0:23:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ah, speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.18,0:23:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you think\NI'd speak for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.27,0:23:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, you grounded tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.53,0:24:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.82,0:24:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom said I was,\Nbut my dad told me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.15,0:24:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just to blow her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's a big party\Nat Stubby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Parents are in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.29,0:24:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be pretty wild.\N- Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.29,0:24:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, you going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.29,0:24:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, because if I do what\Nmy mother tells me not to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.84,0:24:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it's because\Nmy father says it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.72,0:24:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like\Nthis whole big monster deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.14,0:24:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's endless.\NIt's a total drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.30,0:24:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like any minute, divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.68,0:24:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who do you like better?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.02,0:24:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- You like your old man\Nbetter than your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're both screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.19,0:24:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I mean, if you had\Nto choose between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.90,0:24:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.78,0:24:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably go live\Nwith my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.95,0:24:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't think\Neither one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,gives a shit about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.66,0:24:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they use me\Njust to get back at each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.91,0:24:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.17,0:25:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.76,0:25:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're just\Nfeeling sorry for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, well,\Nif I didn't, nobody else would.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.72,0:25:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Aw, you're breaking my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.22,0:25:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sport-o?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.89,0:25:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- You get along\Nwith your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.39,0:25:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, if I say yes\NI'm an idiot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.73,0:25:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're an idiot anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.65,0:25:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you say you get along\Nwith your parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,well, you're a liar, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.79,0:25:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know something, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.37,0:25:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If we weren't in school\Nright now I'd waste you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.21,0:25:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can you hear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.84,0:25:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to turn it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, fellas, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.26,0:25:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like my parents either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.97,0:25:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't, you know,\NI don't, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.39,0:25:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.97,0:25:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Their idea of, you know,\Nparental compassion is just,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, whacko, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.94,0:26:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dork?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.90,0:26:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are a parent's\Nwet dream, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.49,0:26:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look, I can see you getting\Nall bunged up for them
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.41,0:26:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,making you wear\Nthese kind of clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.66,0:26:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but face it,\Nyou're a neo-maxi-zoon-dweebie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.37,0:26:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you be doing\Nif you weren't out
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.71,0:26:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,making yourself\Na better citizen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why do you have\Nto insult everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm being honest, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I would expect you\Nto know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, well, he's got a name.\N- Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. What's your name?\N- Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.06,0:26:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- See?\N- My condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.02,0:26:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.78,0:26:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.32,0:26:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Claire.\N- Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Claire.\NIt's a family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.16,0:26:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, it's a fat girl's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.37,0:26:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, thank you.\N- You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.45,0:26:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm not fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, not at present,\Nbut I could see you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.33,0:27:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,really pushing maximum density.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.50,0:27:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm not sure\Nif you know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are two kinds\Nof fat people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's fat people\Nthat were born to be fat
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's fat people that were\Nonce thin, but they became fat,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.43,0:27:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so when you look at them\Nyou can sort of see
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.18,0:27:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,that thin person inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.81,0:27:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, you're going\Nto get married,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to squeeze out\Na few puppies and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.90,0:27:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.32,0:27:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, obscene finger gestures\Nfrom such a pristine girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.36,0:27:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm not that pristine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.87,0:27:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you a virgin?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.91,0:27:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you a million dollars\Nthat you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.92,0:27:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end the suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.96,0:27:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it going to be\Na white wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why don't you just shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.55,0:27:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you ever\Nkissed a boy on the mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.89,0:28:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever been felt up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.56,0:28:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,over the bra,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.77,0:28:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,under the blouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.11,0:28:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,shoes off,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.53,0:28:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,hoping to God\Nyour parents don't walk in?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.82,0:28:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want me to puke?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.83,0:28:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Over the panties...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,no bra...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.83,0:28:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,blouse unbuttoned...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Calvin's in a ball\Non the front seat
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.55,0:28:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,past 11:00 on a school night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.55,0:28:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy: Leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.31,0:28:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I said leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.36,0:28:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- You going to make me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.03,0:28:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.49,0:29:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- You and how many\Nof your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.50,0:29:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.58,0:29:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.09,0:29:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hits, me hitting you,\Nyou hitting the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.88,0:29:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time you're ready, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.89,0:29:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Bender: I don't want to get\Ninto this with you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.19,0:29:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.48,0:29:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Because I'd kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.65,0:29:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.11,0:29:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd kill you\Nand your fucking parents
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.49,0:29:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,would sue me\Nand it'd be a big mess
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.03,0:29:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't care enough\Nabout you to bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.70,0:29:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Chicken shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.47,0:30:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.35,0:30:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't talk to her,\Nyou don't look at her,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.43,0:30:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and you don't even\Nthink about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.65,0:30:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm trying to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.59,0:30:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Brian, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.42,0:30:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your dad work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.47,0:30:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Carl?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.18,0:30:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I ask you a question?\N- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.19,0:30:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- How does one become a janitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.15,0:30:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want to be a janitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.73,0:30:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I just want to know\Nhow one becomes a janitor
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.15,0:31:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,because Andrew here\Nis very interested in pursuing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.53,0:31:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,a career in the custodial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.57,0:31:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.45,0:31:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys think I'm just\Nsome untouchable peasant,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.58,0:31:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,serf, peon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.25,0:31:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.08,0:31:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But following a broom around\Nafter shitheads like you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,for the last eight years,\NI've learned a couple of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.21,0:31:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I look through your letters,\Nlook through your lockers,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.26,0:31:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I listen to your conversations.\NYou don't know that, but I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.10,0:31:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the eyes and ears\Nof this institution, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.64,0:31:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,\Nthat clock's 20 minutes fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.73,0:31:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(laughing)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.61,0:31:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,(whistling)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.53,0:32:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right, girls,\Nthat's 30 minutes for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.07,0:32:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here?\N- Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.37,0:32:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I think the cafeteria\Nwould be a more suitable place
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.54,0:32:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,for us to eat lunch in, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.12,0:32:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I don't care\Nwhat you think, Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.33,0:32:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dick, excuse me, Rich,\Nwill milk be made available
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.80,0:32:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.84,0:32:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're extremely thirsty, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.55,0:32:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- I have a really\Nlow tolerance for dehydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.34,0:32:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've seen her dehydrate,\Nsir, it's pretty gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.51,0:32:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Relax, I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.35,0:32:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: Uh, uh, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.52,0:32:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab some wood there, bub.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.15,0:33:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What, do you think\NI was born yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.27,0:33:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to have you\Nroaming these halls?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.32,0:33:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.58,0:33:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.25,0:33:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!\N(snaps fingers)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.29,0:33:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's her name?\NWake her, wake her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.17,0:33:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on,\Non your feet, missy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.84,0:33:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no rest home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.55,0:33:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a soft drink machine\Nin the teacher's lounge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.72,0:33:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.43,0:33:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- So...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.10,0:33:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what's your poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.15,0:33:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, forget I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.61,0:33:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.78,0:33:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.58,0:33:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When do you drink vodka?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.62,0:33:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Whenever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:33:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- A lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.75,0:34:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.79,0:34:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that why you're here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.84,0:34:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?\N- Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.93,0:34:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm here today because...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.48,0:34:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,because my coach and my father\Ndon't want me to blow my ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.56,0:34:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I get treated differently\Nbecause...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.65,0:34:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,coach thinks I'm a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.61,0:34:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So does my old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.61,0:34:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a winner\Nbecause I want to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.28,0:34:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a winner because\NI got strength and speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.74,0:34:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of like a racehorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.24,0:34:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's about how involved I am\Nin what's happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.62,0:34:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.96,0:34:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.55,0:34:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, why don't you tell me\Nwhy you're really in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.80,0:34:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.68,0:35:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.31,0:35:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see a picture\Nof a guy with elephantitis
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.85,0:35:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,of the nuts?\NIt's pretty tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.90,0:35:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.23,0:35:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- How do you think\Nhe rides a bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.65,0:35:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Claire, would you ever\Nconsider dating a guy like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.74,0:35:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can't you just leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.20,0:35:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- I mean, if he had\Na great personality
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.62,0:35:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and was a good dancer\Nand had a cool car.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.25,0:35:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you'd probably have\Nto ride in the backseat
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.37,0:35:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,because his nuts\Nwould ride shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.96,0:35:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know what\NI wish I was doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.42,0:35:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Watch what you say.\NBrian here is a cherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.47,0:35:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- A cherry?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.55,0:35:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- I wish I was in a plane\Nto France.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.31,0:35:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm not a cherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.47,0:35:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- When have you ever\Ngotten laid?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.27,0:35:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've laid lots of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.44,0:35:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Name one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.85,0:35:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- She lives in Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.31,0:35:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Met her at Niagara Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.61,0:35:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.78,0:35:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ever laid anyone around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.49,0:35:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you and Claire did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.37,0:35:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.70,0:36:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nothing. Nothing.\NLet's just drop it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.62,0:36:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll talk about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.87,0:36:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, drop what?\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.50,0:36:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, Brian's trying\Nto tell me that in addition
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.29,0:36:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,to the number of girls\Nin the Niagara Falls area
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.84,0:36:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that presently you and he\Nare riding the hobby horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.92,0:36:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- You little pig.\N- No, I'm not. I'm n--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.59,0:36:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,John said I was a cherry\Nand I said I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.\NThat's all that was said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.35,0:36:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, then what were you\Nmotioning to Claire for?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.43,0:36:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know,\NI don't appreciate this
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.68,0:36:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,very much, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.93,0:36:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- He is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.39,0:36:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, you weren't\Nmotioning to Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.73,0:36:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know he's lying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.07,0:36:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Were you or were you not\Nmotioning to Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.40,0:36:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, but it was only\Nbecause I didn't want her
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.41,0:36:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to know I was a virgin, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.95,0:36:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for being a virgin.\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.75,0:36:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why didn't you want me\Nto know you were a virgin?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.96,0:36:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Because\Nit's personal business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.29,0:36:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my personal\Nprivate business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.92,0:36:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, Brian,\Nit doesn't sound like
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.38,0:36:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you're doing any business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.55,0:36:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think it's okay\Nfor a guy to be a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.59,0:36:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.85,0:37:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.44,0:37:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.77,0:37:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.98,0:37:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.11,0:37:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're nauseating.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.63,0:37:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's that?
