Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.01,0:37:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sushi?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.80,0:37:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Rice, raw fish, and seaweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.68,0:37:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- You won't accept\Na guy's tongue in your mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.48,0:37:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're going to eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.98,0:37:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.35,0:37:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.98,0:37:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.10,0:38:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.49,0:38:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(swishes drink)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.83,0:39:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are we having?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.75,0:39:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just your standard\Nregular lunch, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.71,0:39:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.80,0:39:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.64,0:39:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's apple juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.76,0:39:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.72,0:39:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,PB and J\Nwith the crusts cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.60,0:39:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Brian, this is\Na very nutritious lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.65,0:39:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All the food groups\Nare represented.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.98,0:40:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your mom\Nmarry Mister Rogers?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.11,0:40:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, Mr. Johnson.\N- Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.03,0:40:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my impression\Nof life at Big Bri's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.25,0:40:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Son?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.00,0:40:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.55,0:40:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How was your day, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.09,0:40:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, Dad.\NHow's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Super.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.76,0:40:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, son, how'd you like\Nto go fishing this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.27,0:40:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.27,0:40:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got homework to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.52,0:40:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all right, son,\Nyou can do it on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.19,0:40:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.32,0:40:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, isn't our son swell?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.62,0:40:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, dear, isn't life swell?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.87,0:40:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.89,0:41:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right,\Nwhat about your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What, mine?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.01,0:41:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's real easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.19,0:41:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid, worthless,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.70,0:41:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,no good, goddamn,\Nfreeloading son of a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.82,0:41:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,retarded, big mouth,\Nknow-it-all asshole, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.25,0:41:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot ugly, lazy,\Nand disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.38,0:41:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.05,0:41:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go fix me a turkey pot pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.13,0:41:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.01,0:41:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.01,0:41:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Dad, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.93,0:41:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.97,0:41:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Dad, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.18,0:41:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.11,0:42:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.23,0:42:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want to come over\Nsome time?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.73,0:42:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's bullshit.\NIt's all part of your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.74,0:42:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe a word of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.07,0:42:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- You don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.99,0:42:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- No?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.11,0:42:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did I stutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.29,0:42:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.09,0:42:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.71,0:42:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about the size of a cigar.\NDo I stutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.88,0:42:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See, this is what you get\Nin my house
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.89,0:42:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,when you spill paint\Nin the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.89,0:42:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I don't think that I need\Nto sit with you fucking dildos
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.89,0:42:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.15,0:42:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.22,0:43:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- You shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.76,0:43:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- How did I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.31,0:43:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he lies\Nabout everything anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.08,0:43:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.37,0:43:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.08,0:43:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they scraped it\Noff the bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.87,0:43:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Mississippi River.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.38,0:43:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's polluted.\NThe coffee's polluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.76,0:43:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids are polluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.06,0:44:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- How do you know\Nwhere Vernon went?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.48,0:44:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.07,0:44:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, then how do you know\Nwhen he'll be back?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.11,0:44:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.36,0:44:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Being bad feels pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.24,0:44:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's the point\Nof going to Bender's locker?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.04,0:44:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.25,0:44:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.87,0:44:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they think, why are\Nwe risking getting caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.50,0:44:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- So, then, what are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.21,0:44:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- You ask me one more question\Nand I'm beating the shit
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.51,0:44:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.51,0:44:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.43,0:44:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're such a slob.
