Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.46,0:45:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That was marijuana.\N- Shut up, dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.34,0:45:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you approve of this?
