Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.15,0:45:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If Vernon cuts us off\Nit's your fault, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.15,0:45:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Brian: What'd he say?
