Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.62,0:46:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, you don't know\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.00,0:46:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we're through\Nlistening to you.
