Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.36,0:46:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.53,0:46:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Great idea, jack off.\N- Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.20,0:47:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fuck you!\NWhy didn't you listen to John?
