Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.00,0:47:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I want to lead\Na life of danger ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.38,0:47:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- That son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.68,0:47:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Before the day I die ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.55,0:47:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ There's some things\NI want to buy ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.26,0:47:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Light bulbs,\Nlight bulbs, automobile ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.68,0:47:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,♪--and a Ferris wheel ♪
