Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.38,0:48:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?\N- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.01,0:48:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Out. That's it, Bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.26,0:48:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Out. It's over.
