Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.43,0:48:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.77,0:48:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm thinking of trying out\Nfor a scholarship.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.48,0:48:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the ball, Bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.44,0:48:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.54,0:48:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your stuff, let's go.
