Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.34,0:48:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to inform you\Nyou're going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.38,0:48:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,without his services\Nfor the rest of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.76,0:48:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- B-O-O-H-O-O.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.76,0:48:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everything's a big joke,\Nhuh, Bender?
