Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.40,0:49:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What if your home,\Nwhat if your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.53,0:49:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,what if your dope was on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.49,0:49:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Impossible, sir.\NIt's in Johnson's underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.41,0:49:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, you think he's funny?\NYou think this is cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.12,0:49:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he's bitching?\NIs that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.04,0:49:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.58,0:49:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.38,0:49:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.50,0:49:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see something funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.05,0:49:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You go visit John Bender\Nin five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.67,0:49:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll see\Nhow goddamn funny he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.52,0:49:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, John,\Nyou going to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.77,0:49:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.15,0:49:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, keep your\Nfucking hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.82,0:49:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect better manners\Nfrom you, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For better hallway vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.75,0:50:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's the last time, Bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.21,0:50:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last time\Nyou ever make me look bad
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.67,0:50:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of those kids,\Ndo you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.47,0:50:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I make $31,000 a year\Nand I've got a home
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.72,0:50:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm not about to throw it\Naway on some punk like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.22,0:50:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But someday, man, someday\Nwhen you're out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.85,0:50:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and you've forgotten\Nall about this place
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.23,0:50:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and they've forgotten\Nall about you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.85,0:50:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're wrapped up\Nin your own pathetic life,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.73,0:50:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.36,0:50:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.74,0:50:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to kick\Nthe living shit out of you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.40,0:50:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to knock\Nyour dick in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.95,0:50:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- You threatening me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.20,0:50:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you going\Nto do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.92,0:50:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You think anybody's\Ngoing to believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.21,0:50:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You think anybody is going\Nto take your word over mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.26,0:50:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a man of respect\Naround here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.84,0:50:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They love me around here.\NI'm a swell guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.93,0:50:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lying sack of shit\Nand everybody knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.27,0:51:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a tough guy.\NHey, hey, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.77,0:51:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your feet, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.36,0:51:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out\Nhow tough you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.15,0:51:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know right now\Nhow tough you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.32,0:51:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll give you\Nthe first punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.82,0:51:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Come on. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.36,0:51:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take the first shot,\Nplease, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.82,0:51:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a shot right here.\NCome on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.79,0:51:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take one shot.\NThat's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.50,0:51:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.84,0:51:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.64,0:51:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a gutless turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.84,0:52:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Naked blonde walks into a bar\Nwith a poodle under one arm
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.52,0:52:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and a tube of salami\Nunder the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.44,0:52:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She lays the poodle\Non the table, bartender says,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.27,0:52:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"I suppose you won't be\Nneeding a drink."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.57,0:52:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The naked lady says--
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.03,0:52:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.82,0:52:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: Jesus Christ almighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.75,0:52:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forgot my pencil.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.09,0:52:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.47,0:53:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What in God's name\Nis going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.39,0:53:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.89,0:53:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- What ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.43,0:53:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was just in my office\Nand I heard a ruckus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.27,0:53:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Could you describe\Nthe ruckus, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.94,0:53:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Watch your tongue,\Nyoung man, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.82,0:53:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,(grunts)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.11,0:53:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vernon: What is this?\N- Whoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.66,0:53:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is that?\NWhat, what is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.37,0:53:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that noise?\NAndy: What noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.70,0:53:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: Really, sir,\Nthere wasn't any noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.75,0:53:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,(gasps)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.62,0:53:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- (grunts)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.00,0:53:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.01,0:53:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- That noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.42,0:53:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that the noise\Nyou were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.68,0:53:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.97,0:53:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That was not the noise\NI was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.51,0:53:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now, I may not have\Ncaught you in the act this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.10,0:53:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can bet I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.64,0:53:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- (coughs)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.77,0:53:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- You make book on that, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.94,0:53:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, I will not be\Nmade a fool of.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.13,0:54:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.46,0:54:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.71,0:54:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.97,0:54:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- So Ahab, can I have\Nall my doobage?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.03,0:54:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yo, wasteoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.53,0:54:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to blaze up\Nin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.76,0:55:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,(clears throat)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.43,0:55:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,(mouthing words)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.12,0:55:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- (sighs) Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.81,0:55:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- (laughing)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.30,0:56:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Chicks cannot hold their smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.93,0:56:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.14,0:56:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you know how popular I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.73,0:56:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so popular, everybody\Nloves me so much at this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.69,0:56:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Brian: Poor baby. (laughing)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.91,0:56:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.50,0:56:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: (giggles)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.81,0:57:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.32,0:57:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(whistles)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.79,0:57:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(screams)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.79,0:57:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.00,0:57:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,(cheering)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.17,0:57:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.28,0:58:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.61,0:58:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Tierney.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.66,0:58:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A history\Nof slight mental illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.91,0:58:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.33,0:58:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder he's so fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.04,0:58:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Afternoon, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.04,0:58:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Carl, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.71,0:58:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good.\N- Good. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.21,0:58:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not much.\NWhat's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.21,0:58:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing\Nin the basement files?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.67,0:58:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, nothing. Nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.88,0:58:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing\Na little homework here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.59,0:58:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Homework, huh?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.10,0:58:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Confidential files, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.06,0:58:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, look, Carl,\Nthis is a highly sensitive area
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.98,0:58:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and I tell you something,\Ncertain people would be
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.69,0:58:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,very, very embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.73,0:58:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I would really appreciate it\Nif this would be something
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.23,0:58:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that you and I\Ncould keep between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.74,0:58:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you going\Nto do for me, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.91,0:58:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- What would you like?\N- You got 50 bucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.24,0:58:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- 50 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.25,0:58:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, no, no, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.75,0:59:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you got a middle name?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.38,0:59:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.05,0:59:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your middle name is Ralph,\Nas in puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.30,0:59:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your birth date's March 12th,\Nyou're 5'9 1/2",
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.39,0:59:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you weigh 130 pounds\Nand your social security number
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.14,0:59:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,is 049-38-0913.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.32,0:59:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wow, are you psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.82,0:59:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.99,0:59:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would you mind telling me\Nhow you know all this about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.16,0:59:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- I stole your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.75,0:59:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give it to me.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.96,0:59:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.00,0:59:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great.\NYou're a thief, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.29,0:59:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm not a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.38,0:59:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Multi-talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.96,0:59:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's there to steal?\NTwo bucks and a beaver shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.84,0:59:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.93,0:59:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's got a nudie picture\Nin there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.26,0:59:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it. It's perverted.\N- All right, let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.36,1:00:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are all these\Nyour girlfriends?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.15,1:00:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Some of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.28,1:00:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.78,1:00:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, some I consider\Nmy girlfriends
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.86,1:00:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and some I just consider.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.37,1:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Consider what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.08,1:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Whether or not I want\Nto hang out with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.00,1:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- You don't believe\Nin just one guy, one girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.46,1:00:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.17,1:00:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way it should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.25,1:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.05,1:00:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.88,1:00:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- How come you got\Nso much shit in your purse?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.01,1:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- How come you have\Nso many girlfriends?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.80,1:00:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- I asked you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.93,1:00:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.97,1:00:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I never\Nthrow anything away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.02,1:00:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.14,1:00:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.48,1:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is the worst\Nfake I.D. I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.44,1:00:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize\Nyou made yourself 68?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.82,1:00:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I know, I know.\NI goofed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.86,1:00:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you need\Na fake I.D. for?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.78,1:00:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- So I can vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.08,1:01:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want to see\Nwhat's in my bag?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.33,1:01:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.43,1:01:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.89,1:01:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.27,1:01:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you always carry\Nthis much shit in your bag?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.98,1:01:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.81,1:01:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I always carry this much shit\Nin my bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.57,1:01:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know\Nwhen you may have to jam.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.07,1:01:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you going to be like\Na shopping bag lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.53,1:01:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, like,\Nsit in alleyways and, like,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.12,1:01:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,talk to buildings\Nand wear men's shoes
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.33,1:01:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and that kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.54,1:01:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll do what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.29,1:01:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why do you have\Nto do anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.46,1:01:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- My home life...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.09,1:01:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,is unsatisfying.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.43,1:01:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- So you're saying\Nyou'd subject yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.93,1:02:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to the violent dangers\Nof these Chicago streets
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.43,1:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,because your home life\Nis unsatisfying?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.56,1:02:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't have to run away\Nand live in the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.98,1:02:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can run away\Nand I can go to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.15,1:02:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go to the country.\NI can go to the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.86,1:02:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go to Israel,\NAfrica, Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.62,1:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Andy, you want\Nto get in on this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.83,1:02:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Allison here says\Nshe wants to run away
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.92,1:02:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,because her home life\Nis unsatisfying.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.55,1:02:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, everyone's home life\Nis unsatisfying.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.30,1:02:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it wasn't, people would\Nlive with their parents forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.18,1:02:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, yeah. I understand,\Nbut I think hers goes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.56,1:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,beyond what, you know,\Nguys like you and me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.39,1:02:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,consider normal unsatisfying.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.02,1:02:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Never mind, forget it,\Neverything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.94,1:02:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's the deal?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.32,1:02:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no deal, sport-o.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.49,1:03:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Leave me alone.\N- Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.07,1:03:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you're carrying all that\Ncrap around in your purse.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.33,1:03:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Either you really want\Nto run away or you want people
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.87,1:03:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to think you want to run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.62,1:03:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Eat shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.25,1:03:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- The girl is an island\Nwith herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.39,1:03:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.27,1:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.44,1:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.52,1:03:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.23,1:03:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.48,1:03:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where do you want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.53,1:03:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.58,1:03:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.42,1:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I have problems?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.00,1:03:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- You do everything\Neverybody ever tells you to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.54,1:03:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.04,1:03:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, fine.\NBut I didn't dump my purse
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.05,1:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the couch and invite\Npeople into my problems,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.30,1:04:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,did I?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.18,1:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.31,1:04:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.78,1:04:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.57,1:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Real bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.20,1:04:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Parents?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.34,1:04:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.77,1:04:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.31,1:04:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- They ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.36,1:05:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.70,1:05:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.04,1:05:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did you want to be\Nwhen you were young?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.00,1:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- When I was a kid I wanted\Nto be John Lennon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.42,1:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Carl, don't be a goof.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.38,1:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to make\Na serious point here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.22,1:05:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Carl, I've been teaching\Nfor 22 years
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.01,1:05:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and each year these kids\Nget more and more arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.10,1:05:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, bullshit, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.81,1:05:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vern, the kids\Nhaven't changed, you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.40,1:05:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You took a teaching position\Nbecause you thought
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.57,1:05:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,it'd be fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.15,1:05:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you could have\Nsummer vacations off
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.32,1:05:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and then you found out\Nit was actually work.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.07,1:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That really bummed you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.16,1:05:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- These kids turned on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.21,1:05:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They think\NI'm a big fucking joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.54,1:06:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.63,1:06:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Vern, if you were 16,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.17,1:06:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,what would you think of you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.76,1:06:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Carl, you think I give\None rat's ass what these kids
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.47,1:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,think of me?\N- Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.72,1:06:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- You think about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.35,1:06:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get old these kids,\Nwhen I get old,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.06,1:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,they're going to be\Nrunning the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.48,1:06:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.15,1:06:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now, this is the thought\Nthat wakes me up
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.53,1:06:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,in the middle of the night,\Nthat when I get older
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.49,1:06:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,these kids are going\Nto take care of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.74,1:06:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- I wouldn't count on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.79,1:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- What would I do\Nfor a million bucks?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.38,1:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'd do\Nas little as I had to.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.88,1:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.38,1:06:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, how am I supposed\Nto answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.42,1:06:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- The idea is to, like,\Nsearch your mind
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.09,1:06:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,for the absolute limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.26,1:06:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.18,1:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,would you drive to school naked?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.40,1:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would I have to get\Nout of the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.73,1:07:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course.\N- In the spring or winter?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.73,1:07:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Doesn't matter.\NSpring.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.69,1:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- In front of the school\Nor in back of the school?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.45,1:07:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Either one.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.41,1:07:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'd do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.79,1:07:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything sexual.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.37,1:07:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a million dollars\Nto do it, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.67,1:07:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.75,1:07:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.59,1:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done just about everything\Nthere is except a few things
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.88,1:07:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,that are illegal.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.47,1:07:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a nymphomaniac.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.34,1:07:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.76,1:07:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are your parents\Naware of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.93,1:07:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- The only person\NI told was my shrink.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.48,1:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did he do\Nwhen you told him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.77,1:07:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- He nailed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.40,1:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.90,1:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't think that\Nfrom a legal standpoint
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.45,1:07:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,what he did can be construed\Nas rape since I paid him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.78,1:07:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's an adult.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.33,1:07:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's married, too.\N- Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.29,1:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea\Nhow completely gross that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.92,1:08:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, the first few times.\N- The first few times?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.29,1:08:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he did it\Nmore than once?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.88,1:08:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sure.\N- Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.26,1:08:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Obviously she's crazy\Nif she's screwing a shrink.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.72,1:08:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you ever done it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.31,1:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't even have\Na psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.23,1:08:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you ever done it\Nwith a normal person?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.64,1:08:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Didn't we already cover this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.81,1:08:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- You never answered\Nthe question.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.61,1:08:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look, I'm not going\Nto discuss my private life
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.23,1:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,with total strangers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.53,1:08:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's kind of\Na double-edged sword, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.95,1:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- A what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.41,1:08:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, if you say you haven't,\Nyou're a prude.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.83,1:08:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say you have,\Nyou're a slut.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.95,1:08:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.37,1:08:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to, but you can't\Nand when you do,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.75,1:08:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you wish you didn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.79,1:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wrong.\N- Or are you a tease?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.96,1:08:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's a tease.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.26,1:08:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sure.\NWhy don't you just forget it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.51,1:08:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, you're a tease\Nand you know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.76,1:08:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All girls are teases.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.39,1:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's only a tease\Nif what she does gets you hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.56,1:08:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.39,1:09:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's why you're a tease.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.98,1:09:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, let me ask you\Na few questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.94,1:09:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- I already told you everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.44,1:09:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- No. Doesn't it bother you\Nto sleep around
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.98,1:09:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,without being in love?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.36,1:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, don't you want\Nany respect?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.40,1:09:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't screw to get respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.99,1:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the difference\Nbetween you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.45,1:09:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's not the only difference,\NI hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.24,1:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Face it, you're a tease.\N- I'm not a tease.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.87,1:09:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sure you are.\NSex is your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.70,1:09:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself.\NYou use it to get respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.96,1:09:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.34,1:09:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She twisted my words around.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.46,1:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you\Nuse it for then?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.59,1:09:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't use it, period.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.47,1:09:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, are you medically frigid\Nor is it psychological?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.47,1:09:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't mean it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.89,1:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are putting words\Ninto my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, if you just\Nanswer the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.39,1:09:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Brian: Why don't you just\Nanswer the question?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.47,1:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy: Be honest.\NBender: No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.89,1:09:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Brian: Yeah, answer it.\NAndy: Just answer the question,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.73,1:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire.\NBender: Talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.98,1:09:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,(all talking at once)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.56,1:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bender: Come on, it's easy.\NIt's only one question.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.73,1:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I never did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.95,1:09:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- I never did it, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.45,1:10:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a nymphomaniac.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.37,1:10:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a compulsive liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.75,1:10:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are such a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.55,1:10:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You did that on purpose\Njust to fuck me over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.76,1:10:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- I would do it, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.38,1:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you love someone, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.01,1:10:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't believe you.\NYou're so weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.30,1:10:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say anything all day\Nand then
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.72,1:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,when you open your mouth\Nyou unload all these
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.02,1:10:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,tremendous lies all over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.64,1:10:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're just pissed off\Nbecause she got you
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.35,1:10:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to admit something\Nyou didn't want to admit to.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.69,1:10:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, fine. But that doesn't\Nmake it any less bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.32,1:10:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's bizarre?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.40,1:10:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all pretty bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.70,1:10:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of us are just better\Nat hiding it, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.03,1:10:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- How are you bizarre?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.83,1:10:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- He can't think for himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.37,1:10:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.00,1:10:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys know what I did\Nto get in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.01,1:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I taped\NLarry Lester's buns together.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.13,1:11:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- That was you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.97,1:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, you know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.68,1:11:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.10,1:11:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, then you know\Nhow hairy he is, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.98,1:11:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when they pulled\Nthe tape off,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.86,1:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,most of his hair came off\Nand some skin, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.57,1:11:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.57,1:11:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- And the bizarre thing is...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.82,1:11:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that I did it for my old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.62,1:11:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I tortured this poor kid\Nbecause I wanted him
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.12,1:11:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to think that I was cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.13,1:11:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always going off about,\Nyou know,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.09,1:11:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,when he was in school,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.46,1:11:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,all the wild things\Nhe used to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.13,1:11:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I got the feeling that\Nhe was disappointed
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.76,1:11:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that I never cut loose\Non anyone, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.14,1:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm sitting\Nin the locker room
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.02,1:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm taping up my knee
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.03,1:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and Larry's undressing a couple\Nof lockers down from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.95,1:12:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's kind of skinny,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.04,1:12:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,weak,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.75,1:12:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and I started thinking\Nabout my father and his attitude
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.67,1:12:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,about weakness
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.17,1:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and the next thing I knew...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.72,1:12:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I jumped on top of him\Nand started wailing on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.06,1:12:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my friends, they just\Nlaughed and cheered me on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.90,1:12:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And afterwards...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.53,1:12:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,when I was sitting\Nin Vernon's office...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.99,1:12:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,all I could think about...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.20,1:12:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,was Larry's father...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.91,1:12:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and Larry having to go home...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.79,1:13:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and explain\Nwhat happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.13,1:13:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the humiliation...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.22,1:13:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the fucking humiliation\Nhe must have felt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.65,1:13:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been unreal.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.32,1:13:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, how do you apologize\Nfor something like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.16,1:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.29,1:13:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because\Nof me and my old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.17,1:13:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I fucking hate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.72,1:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like this mindless machine
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.26,1:13:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,that I can't even\Nrelate to anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.02,1:13:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.23,1:13:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be number one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.19,1:13:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tolerate\Nany losers in this family.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.23,1:14:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your intensity is for shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.28,1:14:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Win, win, win!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.53,1:14:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.87,1:14:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know sometimes\NI wish my knee would give
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.58,1:14:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I wouldn't be able\Nto wrestle anymore
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.17,1:14:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and he could\Nforget all about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.30,1:14:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think your old man\Nand my old man
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.55,1:14:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,should get together\Nand go bowling.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.22,1:14:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's like me\Nand, like, with my grades.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.31,1:14:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, when I step\Noutside myself, kind of,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.31,1:14:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and, like, when I look in\Nat myself, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.90,1:14:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.24,1:14:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like what I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.95,1:14:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.00,1:14:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.12,1:15:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.04,1:15:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sounds stupid, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.26,1:15:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm failing shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.93,1:15:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we had\Nthis assignment, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.22,1:15:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,to make this, like,\Nceramic elephant
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.81,1:15:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and we had eight weeks to do it\Nand then, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.69,1:15:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we're supposed to,\Nit's like a lamp,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.36,1:15:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,when, you know,\Nwhen you pull the trunk,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.23,1:15:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the light was supposed to go on
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.24,1:15:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and, you know,\Nmy light didn't go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.70,1:15:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an F on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.08,1:15:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never got an F in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.00,1:15:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,When I signed up, you know,\Nfor the course, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.08,1:15:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was playing it\Nreal smart, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.79,1:15:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,because I thought, you know,\NI'll take shop
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.88,1:15:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and it'd be such an easy way to\Nmaintain my grade point average.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.88,1:15:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why'd you think it'd be easy?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.01,1:15:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you seen some\Nof the dopes that take shop?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.10,1:15:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- I take shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.39,1:15:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.77,1:15:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm a fucking idiot\Nbecause I can't make a lamp?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.98,1:16:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, you're a genius\Nbecause you can't make a lamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.77,1:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you know\Nabout trigonometry?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.02,1:16:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- I could care less\Nabout trigonometry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.86,1:16:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bender, did you know\Nwithout trigonometry
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.11,1:16:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there'd be no engineering?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.28,1:16:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Without lamps\Nthere'd be no light.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.95,1:16:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, so neither one of you\Nis any better than
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.99,1:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.12,1:16:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can write with my toes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.75,1:16:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can also eat, brush my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.17,1:16:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- With your feet?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.67,1:16:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Play {\i1}Heart and Soul{\i0}\Non the piano.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.25,1:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can make spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.13,1:16:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What can you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.01,1:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can tape all\Nof your buns together.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.80,1:16:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want to see\Nwhat Claire can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.31,1:16:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.43,1:16:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, everybody\Ncan do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.23,1:16:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's one thing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.44,1:16:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, forget it.\NIt's way too embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- You ever seen Wild Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.19,1:16:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that guy's been\Ndoing that show for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.82,1:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.99,1:16:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to swear to God\Nyou won't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.45,1:16:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.37,1:17:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe\NI'm actually doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.89,1:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yay. (applause)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.06,1:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.35,1:17:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.73,1:17:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you learn to do that?\N- Camp, seventh grade.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.36,1:17:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bender: (clapping)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.45,1:17:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.53,1:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My image of you\Nis totally blown.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.12,1:17:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're a shit.\NDon't do that to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.50,1:17:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You swore to God\Nyou wouldn't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.29,1:17:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Am I laughing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.83,1:17:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- You fucking prick!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.09,1:17:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you care\Nwhat I think anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.26,1:17:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even count, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.88,1:17:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I could disappear forever\Nand it wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.84,1:18:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.10,1:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I may as well not even exist\Nat this school, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.06,1:18:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And you don't like me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.53,1:18:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know, I have just\Nas many feelings as you do
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.95,1:18:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and it hurts just as much when\Nsomebody steps all over them.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.53,1:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- God, you're so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.20,1:18:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever, ever\Ncompare yourself to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.91,1:18:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You got everything\Nand I got shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.92,1:18:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking Rapunzel, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.00,1:18:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,School would probably fucking\Nshut down if you didn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.13,1:18:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Queenie isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.01,1:18:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I like those earrings, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.43,1:18:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.59,1:18:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are those\Nreal diamonds, Claire?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.97,1:18:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut up.\N- I bet they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.27,1:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you work for the money\Nfor those earrings?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.35,1:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.98,1:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Or did your daddy buy those?\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.90,1:18:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- I bet he bought those for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.03,1:18:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet those were\Na Christmas gift, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.11,1:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I got\Nfor Christmas this year?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.99,1:19:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a better fucking year\Nat the old Bender family.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.91,1:19:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a carton of cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.45,1:19:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The old man grabbed me and said,\N"Hey, smoke up, Johnny."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.46,1:19:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so go home\Nand cry to your daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.17,1:19:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.14,1:19:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- My God, are we going\Nto be like our parents?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.19,1:19:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.52,1:19:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.65,1:19:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.57,1:19:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.28,1:19:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: What happens?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.62,1:19:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- When you grow up...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.21,1:19:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,your heart dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.21,1:19:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.38,1:19:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- I care.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.59,1:19:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was just thinking, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.97,1:20:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's kind of a weird time\Nbut I was just wondering...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.22,1:20:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,what is going to happen to us\Non Monday
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.39,1:20:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,when we're all together again?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.35,1:20:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I consider you guys my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.65,1:20:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not wrong, am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.24,1:20:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.15,1:20:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- So, on Monday, what happens?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.53,1:20:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are we still friends,\Nyou mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.08,1:20:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're friends now, that is?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.04,1:20:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.08,1:20:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I want the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.21,1:20:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.09,1:20:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- With all of us or just John?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.47,1:20:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- With all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.09,1:20:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's a real nice\Nattitude, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.26,1:20:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, be honest, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.01,1:20:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If Brian came walking up to you\Nin the hall on Monday,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.48,1:20:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.23,1:20:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, picture this, you're\Nthere with all the sports.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.61,1:20:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you'd do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.15,1:20:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd say hi to him\Nand when he left,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.11,1:20:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd cut him all up\Nso your friends wouldn't think
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.57,1:21:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that you really liked him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.11,1:21:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.24,1:21:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah,\Nwhat if I came up to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.58,1:21:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Same exact thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.37,1:21:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.29,1:21:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?\NBecause I'm telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.75,1:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.25,1:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, because you know\Nhow shitty that is to do
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.50,1:21:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,to someone and you don't got\Nthe balls to stand up
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.46,1:21:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to your friends and tell them\Nthat you're going to like
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.09,1:21:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,who you want to like.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.30,1:21:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, what about you,\Nyou hypocrite?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.30,1:21:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take Allison\Nto one of your heavy metal
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.72,1:21:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,vomit parties?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.31,1:21:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Or take Brian\Nout to the parking lot at lunch
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.06,1:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to get high or what about Andy\Nfor that matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.52,1:21:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.06,1:21:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What would your friends say\Nif we were walking
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.27,1:21:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,down the hall together?\NThey'd laugh their asses off.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.61,1:21:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'd probably tell them\Nthat you were doing it with me
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.44,1:21:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,so they'd forgive you\Nfor being seen with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.28,1:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't you ever talk\Nabout my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.28,1:21:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know\Nany of my friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.74,1:21:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't look\Nat any of my friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.20,1:21:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and you certainly\Nwouldn't condescend
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.78,1:21:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to speak to any of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.33,1:21:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So you just stick\Nto the things that you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.74,1:21:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,shopping, nail polish,\Nyour father's BMW,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.00,1:21:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and your poor, rich drunk mother\Nin the Caribbean.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.62,1:21:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.29,1:21:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- And as far as being concerned\Nabout what's going to happen
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.04,1:21:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,when you and I walk down\Nthe hallways at school,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.50,1:22:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you can forget it because\Nit's never going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.13,1:22:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bury your head in the sand\Nand wait for your fucking prom.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.14,1:22:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- I hate you.\N- Yeah? Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.14,1:22:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, then I assume Allison\Nand I are better people
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.60,1:22:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,than you guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.32,1:22:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Us weirdoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.36,1:22:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.82,1:22:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you do that to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.49,1:22:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.70,1:22:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, if you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.37,1:22:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.29,1:22:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think the kind of\Nfriends I'd have would mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.09,1:22:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- I just want to tell each\Nof you that I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.43,1:22:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't and I will not.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.80,1:22:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I think\Nthat's real shitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.39,1:22:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your friends wouldn't mind\Nbecause they look up to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.23,1:23:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're so conceited, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.44,1:23:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so conceited.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.36,1:23:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so, like,\Nfull of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.86,1:23:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.24,1:23:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm not saying that\Nto be conceited.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.78,1:23:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.41,1:23:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate having to go along\Nwith everything my friends say.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.71,1:23:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Brian: Then why do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.54,1:23:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.\NI don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.75,1:23:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.\NYou don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.72,1:23:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not friends with the same\Nkind of people that Andy and I
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.18,1:23:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,are friends with.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.84,1:23:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you just\Ndon't understand the pressure
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.22,1:23:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that they can put on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.72,1:23:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't understand what?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.56,1:23:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't understand\Npressure, Claire?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.44,1:23:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.44,1:23:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.28,1:23:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why I'm here today?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.70,1:23:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.67,1:24:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.54,1:24:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,because Mr. Ryan\Nfound a gun in the locker.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.39,1:24:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why'd you have a gun\Nin your locker?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.35,1:24:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- I tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.52,1:24:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,\Npull the fucking trunk on it
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.94,1:24:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and the light's\Nsupposed to go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.27,1:24:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't go on.\NI mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.94,1:24:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy: What's the gun for,\NBrian?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.24,1:24:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just forget it.\N- You brought it up, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.66,1:24:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't have an F.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.87,1:24:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have it...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.92,1:24:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know my parents\Ncan't have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.97,1:24:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I ace\Nthe rest of the semester,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.63,1:24:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still only a B.\NEverything's ruined for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.31,1:24:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.36,1:25:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Considering my options,\Nyou know?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.98,1:25:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, killing yourself\Nis not an option.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.94,1:25:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I didn't do it, did I?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.65,1:25:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.24,1:25:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- It was a handgun?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.83,1:25:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- It was a flare gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.66,1:25:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Went off in my locker.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.91,1:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.58,1:25:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.21,1:25:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,(clears throat)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.06,1:25:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.98,1:25:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking elephant\Nwas destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.27,1:25:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want to know\Nwhat I did to get in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.95,1:25:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.62,1:25:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have\Nanything better to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.96,1:26:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're laughing at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.46,1:26:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.59,1:26:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.32,1:26:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Things look clear\Nin black and white ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.45,1:26:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The living color\Ntends to dull our sight ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.74,1:26:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Like dynamite ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.37,1:26:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Just imagine my surprise ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.87,1:26:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When I looked into your eyes ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.58,1:26:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And saw through\Nyour disguise ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.42,1:26:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ If we dare expose our hearts ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.47,1:26:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Just to feel\Nthe purest parts ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.76,1:27:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ That's when strange sensations\Nstart to grow ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.06,1:27:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ We are not alone ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.44,1:27:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Find out\Nwhen your cover's blown ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.11,1:27:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ There'll be somebody there\Nto break your fall ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.07,1:27:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ We are not alone ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.32,1:27:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Because when you cut down\Nto the bone ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.66,1:27:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ We're really\Nnot so different after all ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.74,1:27:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Brian?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.07,1:27:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.65,1:28:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you going\Nto write your paper?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.12,1:28:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.74,1:28:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, it's kind of a waste\Nfor all of us
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.16,1:28:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,to write our paper,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.46,1:28:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, that's Vernon\Nwants us to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.67,1:28:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- True, but I think we'd all\Nkind of say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.80,1:28:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- You just don't want to\Nwrite your paper, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.01,1:28:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- True,\Nbut you're the smartest, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.72,1:28:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.85,1:28:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- We trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.77,1:28:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.44,1:28:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.07,1:28:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.61,1:28:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.96,1:28:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.92,1:28:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.63,1:28:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.84,1:29:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.22,1:29:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't stick that in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.76,1:29:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm not sticking it.\NJust close--
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.22,1:29:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait a minute.\NJust go like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.81,1:29:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.77,1:29:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Allison: (squeals)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.07,1:29:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know, you really do look\Na lot better without all that
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.98,1:29:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,black shit on your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.44,1:29:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, I like that black shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.16,1:29:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- This looks a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.99,1:29:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.00,1:29:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.25,1:29:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so nice to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.92,1:29:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Because you're letting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.28,1:30:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- You lost?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.58,1:30:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.92,1:31:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.22,1:31:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Because I knew you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.80,1:31:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know how you said before\Nhow your parents use you
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.97,1:31:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to get back at each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.81,1:31:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't I be outstanding\Nin that capacity?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.60,1:31:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Were you really disgusted\Nabout what I did
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.11,1:31:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,with my lipstick?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.02,1:31:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.90,1:31:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.28,1:31:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.96,1:31:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.92,1:31:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why? Claire did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.34,1:31:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.68,1:31:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nothing's wrong.\NIt's just you're so different.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.27,1:31:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.94,1:32:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that good or bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.15,1:32:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.12,1:32:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- See you, Brian.\N- Hey, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.29,1:32:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- See you next Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.84,1:32:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- You bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.18,1:32:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Won't you come see about me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.10,1:32:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I'll be alone ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.35,1:32:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dancing, you know it, baby ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.94,1:32:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Tell me\Nyour troubles and doubts ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.86,1:32:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Giving me everything\Ninside and out ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.41,1:32:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And love's strange,\Nso real in the dark ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.74,1:33:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Think of the tender things\Nthat we were working on ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.71,1:33:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Slow change\Nmay pull us apart ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.38,1:33:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When the light\Ngets into your heart, baby ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.72,1:33:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't you forget about me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.68,1:33:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't, don't, don't, don't ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.43,1:33:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't you forget about me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.86,1:33:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you stand\Nabove me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.03,1:33:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Look my way,\Nbut never love me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.70,1:33:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Rain keeps falling,\Nrain keeps falling ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.16,1:33:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Down, down, down ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.46,1:33:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you recognize me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.76,1:33:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Call my name or walk on by ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.01,1:33:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Rain keeps falling,\Nrain keeps falling ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.47,1:34:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Down, down, down, down ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.40,1:34:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.48,1:34:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ooh ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.49,1:34:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Brian: "Dear Mr. Vernon,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.32,1:34:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we accept the fact that we had\Nto sacrifice a whole Saturday{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.78,1:34:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in detention for whatever\Nit was we did wrong.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.95,1:34:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But we think you're crazy\Nto make us write an essay{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.50,1:34:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}telling you\Nwho we think we are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.08,1:34:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see us\Nas you want to see us{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.08,1:34:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in the simplest terms\Nwith the most{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.38,1:34:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}convenient definitions,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.30,1:34:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but what we found out is that\Neach one of us is a brain...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.80,1:34:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Andy: And an athlete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Allison: And a basket case.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.51,1:34:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Claire: A princess.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.89,1:34:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bender: And a criminal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.85,1:34:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Brian: Does that\Nanswer your question?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.85,1:34:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sincerely yours,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.23,1:34:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Breakfast Club.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.40,1:34:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't, don't, don't, don't ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.28,1:34:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't you forget about me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.33,1:35:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ As you walk on by ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.41,1:35:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you call my name? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.83,1:35:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ As you walk on by ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.26,1:35:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you call my name? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.93,1:35:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When you walk away ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.49,1:35:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When you walked\Ninto the room ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.91,1:35:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I could see you were no fool ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.33,1:35:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Is that smile a sign for me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.00,1:35:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Only if my heart could see ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.64,1:36:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Will I make your body cry? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.31,1:36:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Cry so loud you'd never hear ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.60,1:36:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In the shadows of my life ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.36,1:36:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Can I take you home tonight? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.58,1:36:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Is your heart\Ntoo hot to hold? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.08,1:36:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Just a flame\Nthat burns my soul ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.08,1:36:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Heart too hot to hold ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.63,1:36:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Too hot, too hot\NToo hot to hold ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.59,1:36:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Heart too hot to hold ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.59,1:36:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Just a flame\Nthat burns my soul ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.52,1:36:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Heart too hot to hold ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.93,1:36:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Too hot, too hot\Ntoo hot to hold ♪
